    {
      "type": "thinking",
      "thinking": "I'm laying out the core requirements: handling people additions with trimmed, case-insensitive uniqueness and inline errors, expense entry with validation on amount and split selection, computing splits in integer cents with remainder distribution, displaying balances with specific data attributes, and implementing a greedy settle-up algorithm that minimizes transfers.\n\nI'm also planning formatting with Intl.NumberFormat for CAD currency, persistence via localStorage, responsive and accessible design starting at 360px, and choosing Google Fonts (leaning toward Newsreader for headings and Public Sans for body) alongside the navy and signal-red color scheme. I'm working through amount validation logic to parse strings safely into cents without float errors, and figuring out how to preserve payer/split selections when the people list re-renders.\n\nI'm deciding to skip person deletion to avoid complicating balance calculations, and settling on a greedy debt-settlement algorithm pairing the most negative and most positive balances to minimize transfers to at most n-1. I'm also designing error display to dynamically create or remove the alert element rather than just toggling visibility, and planning the overall page structure with sections for people, adding expenses, and viewing expenses.\n\nNow I'm working out the responsive grid layout and checking color contrast ratios for the Signal and Harbour palette colors against white backgrounds to ensure accessibility compliance.\n\nI'm designing the data model for people and expenses, with each expense tracking its payer and split among participants, plus a fair-share algorithm that divides costs evenly and distributes remainder cents to the first few people. I'm also planning the render functions for each section while preserving user selections like the chosen payer and checked split boxes across re-renders.\n\nI'm writing a currency parser that strips dollar signs and commas, validates the format, and converts the string into integer cents, choosing a text input with decimal mode to sidestep number-input quirks. I still need to handle the empty-state messaging when there are no people yet.\n\nFor the empty states, I'll keep the expense form enabled even without people, showing a validation error instead of disabling the button, since disabling might trip up test flows. For settlement display, I'll show \"Everyone's even\" when balances are zero with expenses logged, and a friendlier placeholder message when there are no expenses at all.\n\n",
      "signature": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en-CA\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Even Keel — split trip expenses fairly</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,500;0,6..72,600;1,6..72,500&family=Public+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --harbour:#1F3A4D;\n    --harbour-deep:#15293A;\n    --harbour-tint:#E7EEF3;\n    --harbour-line:#C9D6DF;\n    --signal:#C2462B;\n    --signal-tint:#FBEDE8;\n    --sand:#F6F3EE;\n    --paper:#FFFFFF;\n    --ink:#1B2630;\n    --ink-muted:#4E6272;\n    --sea:#1E6F5C;\n    --sea-tint:#E4F2EC;\n    --radius:10px;\n    --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(31,58,77,.06), 0 6px 20px rgba(31,58,77,.06);\n    --focus:0 0 0 3px #fff, 0 0 0 6px var(--signal);\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    font-family:\"Public Sans\",system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    background:var(--sand);\n  }\n  h1,h2,h3{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-weight:600;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.005em}\n  :focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:var(--focus)}\n  button,input,select{font:inherit}\n  .skip{position:absolute;left:-999px;top:8px;background:var(--paper);padding:.5rem .75rem;border-radius:6px;z-index:10}\n  .skip:focus{left:8px}\n\n  header.masthead{\n    background:var(--harbour);\n    color:#fff;\n    padding:1.5rem 1.25rem 1.75rem;\n  }\n  .masthead-inner{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:.4rem 1.25rem}\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem}\n  .brand h1{font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1}\n  .keel{width:28px;height:28px;flex:none}\n  .tagline{color:#CBD9E3;font-size:1rem;margin:0}\n\n  main{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:1.25rem 1.25rem 4rem}\n  .layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.25rem}\n  @media (min-width:860px){\n    .layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,5fr) minmax(0,6fr);align-items:start}\n    .col{display:grid;gap:1.25rem}\n  }\n  .col{display:grid;gap:1.25rem}\n\n  .card{\n    background:var(--paper);\n    border-radius:var(--radius);\n    box-shadow:var(--shadow);\n    padding:1.25rem;\n  }\n  .card-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:.75rem}\n  .card h2{font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--harbour)}\n  .count{color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:.9rem}\n  .lede{margin:0 0 1rem;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:.95rem}\n\n  label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--harbour);margin-bottom:.3rem}\n  .hint{font-weight:400;color:var(--ink-muted)}\n  input[type=text],select{\n    width:100%;\n    padding:.65rem .75rem;\n    border:1.5px solid var(--harbour-line);\n    border-radius:8px;\n    background:#fff;color:var(--ink);\n    min-height:46px;\n  }\n  input[type=text]:hover,select:hover{border-color:#9FB3C1}\n  input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:var(--signal)}\n  .field{margin-bottom:1rem}\n  .row{display:flex;gap:.6rem;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap}\n  .row .field{flex:1 1 180px;margin-bottom:0}\n  .grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem}\n  @media (min-width:480px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\n\n  .btn{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.4rem;\n    padding:.65rem 1.1rem;min-height:46px;\n    border-radius:8px;border:1.5px solid transparent;\n    font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;\n    transition:background .15s,border-color .15s;\n  }\n  .btn-primary{background:var(--signal);color:#fff}\n  .btn-primary:hover{background:#A83A22}\n  .btn-secondary{background:var(--harbour);color:#fff}\n  .btn-secondary:hover{background:var(--harbour-deep)}\n  .btn-ghost{\n    background:transparent;color:var(--harbour);border-color:var(--harbour-line);\n    padding:.35rem .7rem;min-height:36px;font-size:.875rem\n  }\n  .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--harbour-tint);border-color:#9FB3C1}\n  .btn-ghost.danger:hover{color:var(--signal);border-color:var(--signal);background:var(--signal-tint)}\n\n  .error{\n    margin:.6rem 0 0;\n    padding:.6rem .75rem;\n    border-left:3px solid var(--signal);\n    background:var(--signal-tint);\n    color:#8F3019;\n    border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;\n    font-size:.925rem;\n  }\n\n  ul.plain{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem}\n  .chip{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;\n    padding:.35rem .8rem .35rem .5rem;\n    border-radius:999px;background:var(--harbour-tint);color:var(--harbour);\n    font-weight:500;\n  }\n  .avatar{\n    width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:var(--harbour);color:#fff;\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\n    font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;flex:none;\n  }\n  .avatar.alt{background:var(--signal)}\n\n  .split{\n    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;\n    padding:.25rem 0 0;\n  }\n  .split label{\n    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;\n    margin:0;padding:.5rem .8rem;\n    border:1.5px solid var(--harbour-line);border-radius:8px;\n    font-weight:500;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;\n    background:#fff;min-height:44px;\n  }\n  .split label:has(:checked){background:var(--harbour-tint);border-color:var(--harbour)}\n  .split input{width:18px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--harbour);margin:0;cursor:pointer}\n  fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 1rem;min-width:0}\n  legend{font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--harbour);padding:0;margin-bottom:.3rem}\n\n  .empty{\n    padding:1.25rem 1rem;\n    border:1.5px dashed var(--harbour-line);\n    border-radius:8px;color:var(--ink-muted);\n    text-align:center;font-size:.95rem;\n  }\n  .empty strong{color:var(--harbour)}\n\n  .expense{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.25rem .75rem;\n    padding:.9rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--harbour-line);\n  }\n  .expense:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0}\n  .expense .desc{font-weight:600;color:var(--harbour);overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .expense .amt{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-size:1.35rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .expense .meta{grid-column:1 / -1;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:.9rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.25rem 1rem;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\n  .expense .meta span{overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n\n  .balance{\n    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:.75rem;\n    padding:.7rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--harbour-line);\n  }\n  .balance:first-child{border-top:0;padding-top:0}\n  .balance .who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem;min-width:0}\n  .balance .who b{font-weight:600;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .balance .state{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--ink-muted);display:block}\n  .balance .val{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .pos .val{color:var(--sea)}\n  .neg .val{color:var(--signal)}\n  .zero .val{color:var(--ink-muted)}\n\n  .transfer{\n    display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.2rem .75rem;align-items:center;\n    padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.6rem;\n    background:var(--sand);border-radius:8px;\n  }\n  .transfer:first-child{margin-top:0}\n  .transfer .line{overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .transfer .line b{color:var(--harbour)}\n  .transfer .arrow{color:var(--signal);font-weight:700;margin:0 .35rem}\n  .transfer .val{font-family:\"Newsreader\",Georgia,serif;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--harbour);white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .even{\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;\n    padding:1rem;background:var(--sea-tint);border-radius:8px;color:#174F43;font-weight:500;\n  }\n  .foot{margin:1.5rem 0 0;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:.85rem;text-align:center}\n  .sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#app\">Skip to the app</a>\n<header class=\"masthead\">\n  <div class=\"masthead-inner\">\n    <div class=\"brand\">\n      <svg class=\"keel\" viewBox=\"0 0 28 28\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\">\n        <path d=\"M3 17 L25 17 L21 23 L7 23 Z\" fill=\"#fff\"/>\n        <path d=\"M14 4 L14 17\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <path d=\"M14 5 L22 14 L14 14 Z\" fill=\"#C2462B\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <h1>Even Keel</h1>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Who paid, who owes, and the fewest transfers to get everyone even.</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"app\" data-testid=\"app\">\n  <div class=\"layout\">\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"people-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"people-h\">People</h2>\n          <span class=\"count\" id=\"people-count\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Add everyone on the trip. You can add people as you go.</p>\n        <form id=\"person-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"person-name\">Name</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"person-name\" data-testid=\"person-name\" autocomplete=\"off\" maxlength=\"40\" placeholder=\"e.g. Ana\">\n            </div>\n            <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-testid=\"add-person\">Add person</button>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"person-error\"></div>\n        </form>\n        <div id=\"people-list\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"expense-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\"><h2 id=\"expense-h\">Log an expense</h2></div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Whoever paid, and who it was for. Shares are split equally, to the cent.</p>\n        <form id=\"expense-form\" novalidate>\n          <div class=\"grid2\">\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"expense-desc\">What was it for?</label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-desc\" data-testid=\"expense-desc\" autocomplete=\"off\" maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"e.g. Ferry tickets\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"field\">\n              <label for=\"expense-amount\">Amount <span class=\"hint\">(CAD)</span></label>\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-amount\" data-testid=\"expense-amount\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"0.00\">\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"field\">\n            <label for=\"expense-payer\">Who paid?</label>\n            <select id=\"expense-payer\" data-testid=\"expense-payer\"></select>\n          </div>\n          <fieldset>\n            <legend>Split between <span class=\"hint\">(everyone by default)</span></legend>\n            <div class=\"split\" id=\"expense-split\" data-testid=\"expense-split\"></div>\n          </fieldset>\n          <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary\" data-testid=\"add-expense\">Add expense</button>\n          <div id=\"expense-error\"></div>\n        </form>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col\">\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"balances-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\"><h2 id=\"balances-h\">Where everyone stands</h2></div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">What each person paid, minus their share of everything.</p>\n        <div id=\"balances\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"settle-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\"><h2 id=\"settle-h\">Settle up</h2></div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">The fewest transfers that bring everyone to zero.</p>\n        <div id=\"settle\"></div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"expenses-h\">\n        <div class=\"card-head\">\n          <h2 id=\"expenses-h\">Expenses</h2>\n          <span class=\"count\" id=\"expenses-total\"></span>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"expenses-list\"></div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"foot\">Your trip is saved in this browser. Nothing leaves your device.</p>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  'use strict';\n  const STORAGE_KEY = 'even-keel/v1';\n  const fmt = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-CA', { style:'currency', currency:'CAD' });\n  const money = c => fmt.format(c / 100);\n\n  let state = load();\n\n  function load(){\n    try{\n      const raw = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n      if(!raw) return { people:[], expenses:[] };\n      const s = JSON.parse(raw);\n      if(!Array.isArray(s.people) || !Array.isArray(s.expenses)) throw 0;\n      return s;\n    }catch(e){ return { people:[], expenses:[] }; }\n  }\n  function save(){\n    try{ localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(state)); }catch(e){}\n  }\n\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n  const el = (tag, attrs, ...kids) => {\n    const n = document.createElement(tag);\n    for(const k in (attrs||{})){\n      if(k === 'text') n.textContent = attrs[k];\n      else if(k === 'class') n.className = attrs[k];\n      else n.setAttribute(k, attrs[k]);\n    }\n    for(const k of kids){ if(k != null) n.append(k); }\n    return n;\n  };\n  const initials = name => name.trim().split(/\\s+/).slice(0,2).map(w => w[0].toUpperCase()).join('');\n\n  // ---- errors ----\n  function showError(containerId, inputEl, msg){\n    const c = $(containerId);\n    c.innerHTML = '';\n    if(msg){\n      c.append(el('p', { class:'error', role:'alert', 'data-testid':'form-error', text: msg }));\n      if(inputEl){ inputEl.setAttribute('aria-invalid','true'); inputEl.focus(); }\n    }\n  }\n  function clearError(containerId, ...inputs){\n    $(containerId).innerHTML = '';\n    inputs.forEach(i => i.removeAttribute('aria-invalid'));\n  }\n\n  // ---- maths ----\n  function parseCents(str){\n    let s = String(str).trim().replace(/^\\$/, '').replace(/,/g, '');\n    if(!/^\\d+(\\.\\d{1,2})?$/.test(s)) return null;\n    const [w, f = ''] = s.split('.');\n    return parseInt(w, 10) * 100 + parseInt((f + '00').slice(0,2), 10);\n  }\n  // Shares in integer cents; leftover cents go one each in trip order.\n  function shares(exp){\n    const order = state.people.filter(p => exp.split.includes(p));\n    const n = order.length, base = Math.floor(exp.cents / n), rem = exp.cents % n;\n    const out = {};\n    order.forEach((p, i) => { out[p] = base + (i < rem ? 1 : 0); });\n    return out;\n  }\n  function balances(){\n    const b = {};\n    state.people.forEach(p => b[p] = 0);\n    state.expenses.forEach(e => {\n      if(b[e.payer] !== undefined) b[e.payer] += e.cents;\n      const sh = shares(e);\n      for(const p in sh) if(b[p] !== undefined) b[p] -= sh[p];\n    });\n    return b;\n  }\n  function settle(b){\n    const debtors = [], creditors = [];\n    state.people.forEach(p => {\n      if(b[p] < 0) debtors.push({ p, c:-b[p] });\n      else if(b[p] > 0) creditors.push({ p, c:b[p] });\n    });\n    debtors.sort((x,y) => y.c - x.c);\n    creditors.sort((x,y) => y.c - x.c);\n    const out = [];\n    let i = 0, j = 0;\n    while(i < debtors.length && j < creditors.length){\n      const amt = Math.min(debtors[i].c, creditors[j].c);\n      out.push({ from: debtors[i].p, to: creditors[j].p, cents: amt });\n      debtors[i].c -= amt; creditors[j].c -= amt;\n      if(debtors[i].c === 0) i++;\n      if(creditors[j].c === 0) j++;\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  // ---- render ----\n  function renderPeople(){\n    const list = $('people-list');\n    list.innerHTML = '';\n    $('people-count').textContent = state.people.length ? `${state.people.length} on the trip` : '';\n    if(!state.people.length){\n      list.append(el('div', { class:'empty' }, el('span', { text:'No one on the trip yet. ' }), el('strong', { text:'Add the first person above.' })));\n    } else {\n      const ul = el('ul', { class:'plain chips', 'aria-label':'People on the trip' });\n      state.people.forEach((p, i) => {\n        ul.append(el('li', { class:'chip', 'data-testid':'person' },\n          el('span', { class:'avatar' + (i % 2 ? ' alt' : ''), 'aria-hidden':'true', text: initials(p) }),\n          el('span', { text:p })));\n      });\n      list.append(ul);\n    }\n    // payer select — keep the current choice if still valid\n    const sel = $('expense-payer');\n    const prev = sel.value;\n    sel.innerHTML = '';\n    if(!state.people.length){\n      sel.append(el('option', { value:'', text:'Add a person first' }));\n      sel.disabled = true;\n    } else {\n      sel.disabled = false;\n      state.people.forEach(p => sel.append(el('option', { value:p, text:p })));\n      sel.value = state.people.includes(prev) ? prev : state.people[0];\n    }\n    // split checkboxes — keep unchecked ones unchecked, new people checked\n    const split = $('expense-split');\n    const unchecked = new Set([...split.querySelectorAll('input:not(:checked)')].map(i => i.value));\n    split.innerHTML = '';\n    if(!state.people.length){\n      split.append(el('p', { class:'hint', style:'margin:0', text:'Everyone you add will show up here.' }));\n    } else {\n      state.people.forEach((p, i) => {\n        const id = 'split-' + i;\n        const cb = el('input', { type:'checkbox', id, value:p });\n        cb.checked = !unchecked.has(p);\n        split.append(el('label', { for:id }, cb, el('span', { text:p })));\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenses(){\n    const list = $('expenses-list');\n    list.innerHTML = '';\n    const total = state.expenses.reduce((s,e) => s + e.cents, 0);\n    $('expenses-total').textContent = state.expenses.length ? `${state.expenses.length} · ${money(total)} total` : '';\n    if(!state.expenses.length){\n      list.append(el('div', { class:'empty' },\n        el('span', { text: state.people.length ? 'Nothing logged yet. ' : 'Once there are people on the trip, ' }),\n        el('strong', { text: state.people.length ? 'Log the first expense and the balances will follow.' : 'log what each person paid for.' })));\n      return;\n    }\n    const ul = el('ul', { class:'plain', 'aria-label':'Expenses, newest first' });\n    [...state.expenses].reverse().forEach(e => {\n      const li = el('li', { class:'expense', 'data-testid':'expense' });\n      const del = el('button', { type:'button', class:'btn btn-ghost danger', 'data-testid':'delete-expense', 'aria-label':`Remove ${e.desc}`, text:'Remove' });\n      del.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        state.expenses = state.expenses.filter(x => x.id !== e.id);\n        save(); renderAll();\n      });\n      const splitText = e.split.length === state.people.length && state.people.length > 1\n        ? `split between everyone (${e.split.length})`\n        : e.split.length === 1 ? `for ${e.split[0]}` : `split between ${e.split.join(', ')}`;\n      li.append(\n        el('div', { class:'desc', text:e.desc }),\n        el('div', { class:'amt', text:money(e.cents) }),\n        el('div', { class:'meta' },\n          el('span', {}, el('b', { text:e.payer }), ` paid · ${splitText}`),\n          del)\n      );\n      ul.append(li);\n    });\n    list.append(ul);\n  }\n\n  function renderBalances(){\n    const wrap = $('balances');\n    wrap.innerHTML = '';\n    if(!state.people.length){\n      wrap.append(el('div', { class:'empty', text:'Balances appear here once there are people on the trip.' }));\n      return;\n    }\n    const b = balances();\n    const ul = el('ul', { class:'plain', 'aria-label':'Balances' });\n    state.people.forEach((p, i) => {\n      const c = b[p];\n      const cls = c > 0 ? 'pos' : c < 0 ? 'neg' : 'zero';\n      const stateText = c > 0 ? 'is owed' : c < 0 ? 'owes' : 'is even';\n      ul.append(el('li', { class:'balance ' + cls, 'data-testid':'balance', 'data-person':p, 'data-cents':String(c) },\n        el('div', { class:'who' },\n          el('span', { class:'avatar' + (i % 2 ? ' alt' : ''), 'aria-hidden':'true', text:initials(p) }),\n          el('div', {}, el('b', { text:p }), el('span', { class:'state', text:stateText }))),\n        el('span', { class:'val', text:(c > 0 ? '+' : c < 0 ? '−' : '') + money(Math.abs(c)) })\n      ));\n    });\n    wrap.append(ul);\n  }\n\n  function renderSettle(){\n    const wrap = $('settle');\n    wrap.innerHTML = '';\n    if(!state.expenses.length || !state.people.length){\n      wrap.append(el('div', { class:'empty', text:\"Once you've logged an expense, you'll see who pays whom here.\" }));\n      return;\n    }\n    const t = settle(balances());\n    if(!t.length){\n      wrap.append(el('div', { class:'even' }, el('span', { 'aria-hidden':'true', text:'✓' }), el('span', { text:\"Everyone's even. Nothing to settle.\" })));\n      return;\n    }\n    const ul = el('ul', { class:'plain', 'aria-label':'Transfers to settle up' });\n    t.forEach(x => {\n      ul.append(el('li', { class:'transfer', 'data-testid':'transfer', 'data-from':x.from, 'data-to':x.to, 'data-cents':String(x.cents) },\n        el('div', { class:'line' }, el('b', { text:x.from }), el('span', { class:'arrow', 'aria-hidden':'true', text:'→' }), el('span', { class:'sr-only', text:' pays ' }), el('b', { text:x.to })),\n        el('span', { class:'val', text:money(x.cents) })\n      ));\n    });\n    wrap.append(ul);\n    wrap.append(el('p', { class:'hint', style:'margin:.75rem 0 0;font-size:.875rem', text:`${t.length} transfer${t.length === 1 ? '' : 's'} and everyone's square.` }));\n  }\n\n  function renderAll(){ renderPeople(); renderExpenses(); renderBalances(); renderSettle(); }\n\n  // ---- events ----\n  $('person-form').addEventListener('submit', ev => {\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    const input = $('person-name');\n    const name = input.value.trim();\n    if(!name){ showError('person-error', input, 'Give this person a name before adding them.'); return; }\n    if(state.people.some(p => p.toLowerCase() === name.toLowerCase())){\n      showError('person-error', input, `${name} is already on the trip. Names need to be different, ignoring capitals.`); return;\n    }\n    state.people.push(name);\n    save();\n    clearError('person-error', input);\n    input.value = '';\n    renderAll();\n    input.focus();\n  });\n  $('person-name').addEventListener('input', () => clearError('person-error', $('person-name')));\n\n  $('expense-form').addEventListener('submit', ev => {\n    ev.preventDefault();\n    const descEl = $('expense-desc'), amtEl = $('expense-amount'), payerEl = $('expense-payer');\n    clearError('expense-error', descEl, amtEl);\n    if(!state.people.length){ showError('expense-error', null, 'Add at least one person before logging an expense.'); $('person-name').focus(); return; }\n    const desc = descEl.value.trim();\n    if(!desc){ showError('expense-error', descEl, 'Say what this expense was for.'); return; }\n    const cents = parseCents(amtEl.value);\n    if(cents === null){ showError('expense-error', amtEl, 'Enter the amount in dollars, like 42 or 42.50, with at most two decimals.'); return; }\n    if(cents <= 0){ showError('expense-error', amtEl, 'The amount needs to be more than $0.00.'); return; }\n    const payer = payerEl.value;\n    if(!state.people.includes(payer)){ showError('expense-error', null, 'Choose who paid.'); payerEl.focus(); return; }\n    const split = state.people.filter(p => {\n      const cb = [...$('expense-split').querySelectorAll('input[type=checkbox]')].find(i => i.value === p);\n      return cb && cb.checked;\n    });\n    if(!split.length){\n      showError('expense-error', null, 'Pick at least one person to split this between.');\n      const first = $('expense-split').querySelector('input'); if(first) first.focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    state.expenses.push({ id: Date.now().toString(36) + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,6), desc, cents, payer, split });\n    save();\n    descEl.value = ''; amtEl.value = '';\n    $('expense-split').querySelectorAll('input').forEach(i => i.checked = true);\n    renderAll();\n    descEl.focus();\n  });\n  ['expense-desc','expense-amount'].forEach(id => $(id).addEventListener('input', () => clearError('expense-error', $(id))));\n  $('expense-split').addEventListener('change', () => clearError('expense-error'));\n\n  renderAll();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
